            "text": "theorem bessel_le_odd_partial_sum (k j : ℕ) (hj : 1 ≤ j) (hodd : Odd j)\n    (t : ℝ) (ht0 : 0 ≤ t) (ht : t ≤ 4) :\n    bessel k t ≤ ∑ n ∈ Finset.range j, term k n t"
